From 2459d33b7f3a6ec14d82775a669312e988b26e44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:24:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix starbox orientation in the preview; hires planets
 additive; drop dead star render controller

- Preview places the starbox with the same geometry as the star texture script (SKY_TO_WORLD, SKY_PRE, PLANE_AXES)
- Verified: 14/14 brightest stars in base textures land on their real positions through the three.js pipeline
- Hires planets (z*) use particles_add in config, base/ and public/
- Remove star.render_controller from the exporter (dead section)
- Sync the 12 starbox PNGs from base/ into public/
